    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_918ebdc0156fab1fc6c3",
      "document_start": 106,
      "document_end": 141,
      "text": "由于系统中一些刚体间存在铰（运动副），所以铰限制了刚体之间的相对运动。",
      "section_id": "section_3c29513b998c"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4ce867bcddaa8d9ff8b7",
      "document_start": 141,
      "document_end": 180,
      "text": "一般情况下，描述系统位形的笛卡儿坐标并不完全独立，在运动过程中，它们存在某些关",
      "section_id": "section_3c29513b998c"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_80fbe7480654d4257e40",
      "document_start": 182,
      "document_end": 202,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_3c29513b998c"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_41de57bcbe9f691f2b06",
      "document_start": 203,
      "document_end": 207,
      "text": "# 3.",
      "section_id": "section_3c29513b998c"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1ba217e6761cc1a9273d",
      "document_start": 208,
      "document_end": 215,
      "text": "系统约束方程;",
      "section_id": "section_3c29513b998c"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ce208acee7ce436f2e8d",
      "document_start": 216,
      "document_end": 248,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_3c29513b998c"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_afe0fdfbd66643c1199a",
      "document_start": 250,
      "document_end": 269,
      "text": "系，这些关系的解析表达式就是约束方程。",
      "section_id": "section_3c29513b998c"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_14b190ef0addc7db2d6f",
      "document_start": 269,
      "document_end": 291,
      "text": "约束方程的建立通常有局部方法和总体方法两种。",
      "section_id": "section_3c29513b998c"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ba5d6478d21e0cb23eb5",
      "document_start": 291,
      "document_end": 321,
      "text": "局部方法统一由铰的偶对刚体出发，对同一类铰，约束方程有共性。",
      "section_id": "section_3c29513b998c"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_10911a3a6a25608dd946",
      "document_start": 321,
      "document_end": 339,
      "text": "系统的约束方程是各铰约束方程的组集。",
      "section_id": "section_3c29513b998c"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_38dfce6c98cf3525b3c1",
      "document_start": 339,
      "document_end": 373,
      "text": "而总体方法缺乏这种共性，方程的建立更多地依赖于用户的经验和分析能力。",
      "section_id": "section_3c29513b998c"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b6bb4a54e2149db6758d",
      "document_start": 373,
      "document_end": 425,
      "text": "局部方法得到的约束方程个数虽然可能远大于总体方法，但它是一种程式化的方法，在计算多体动力学中被普遍使用。",
      "section_id": "section_3c29513b998c"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_82de2a11ee6b9a799b66",
      "document_start": 425,
      "document_end": 455,
      "text": "系统受到的约束包括所有铰链的运动约束和驱动器产生的驱动约束。",
      "section_id": "section_3c29513b998c"
    }
